  "description": "eID Mongolia client-side PAdES for .NET (PDF never leaves the client): Prepare → citizen signs the 32-byte DTBS on phone/token → CompleteAsync (RFC 3161 TSA, OCSP/CRL, DSS). Native C# port of the Go reference, byte-identical output. The «My QR» types (GeregeSystems.EidMongolia.Qr) moved to the core package GeregeSystems.EidMongolia in 0.17.0 and are type-forwarded from here, so code built against earlier versions keeps working.",
